    "text": "By Contributor ,\n6 hours ago\nInformation provided by Hollister Police Department. Lea este artículo en español aquí. The Hollister Animal Shelter is taking precautionary measures following confirmed cases of ringworm among animals in our care. Ringworm is a common, treatable fungal infection, but it is highly contagious and can spread between animals, people, and contaminated surfaces.\nRead full article",
